Package: dhis2API
Title: Download Aggregate Data and Metadata from a 'DHIS2' Server
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Mohamed A.",
           family = "Yusuf",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mohamedayusuf87@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: An R client for the Web API of 'DHIS2' (District Health
    Information Software 2). Reads metadata, aggregate data and tracker
    records using a username and password or a personal access token.
    Supports metadata filters, local metadata caching, monthly and weekly
    period identifiers, and downloads split into smaller requests. Stores
    aggregate data in a local 'DuckDB' database, resumes interrupted
    downloads and updates raw data values from changes on the server.
